# 03 — Cleanup, `BLOCKED` Handling, and Readiness Gates (`E11`, `E12`, `E14`)

<!-- GEN: Why: leftover data and orphan processes poison subsequent runs, silent environment workarounds invalidate code under test, and results without an environment record cannot be reproduced. Kind: Mandatory — keep the purpose, adapt the structure (core/authoring-guide.md). -->

